  "prefLabel": "Ed 322.08 Regional Career and Technical Education Center Programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 322.08 Regional Career and Technical Education Center Programs. Each regional career and technical education center program in a leased facility shall be reviewed on an annual basis by the department. The annual review shall indicate a need to lease or to continue leasing space.\n\nSource. #8086, eff 5-26-04; ss by #10363, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13207, eff 5-20-21",
